Evidence RAG for Java — independent Java implementation and evaluation of a text RAG pipeline.

Architecture and reading guide reference RAGFlow by InfiniFlow:
https://github.com/infiniflow/ragflow
RAGFlow is licensed under Apache License 2.0. This project is not an official
Java port and does not claim output equivalence or affiliation.

Runtime libraries include Apache Lucene (Apache Software Foundation) and
Jackson (FasterXML). Their license and notice resources are included in the
bundled dependency archive; consult upstream projects for full attributions.
